    <string name="privacy_text">Cámara has no ads or analytics. Photos and videos are saved in your gallery (DCIM/Camera), like with the phone\'s camera, and never leave it. The microphone only records the sound of videos. Only if you turn on MCP mode, the AI you connect with a token can see your settings and the names and times of your photos (never the images) and, with a read-and-write token, change the settings, through the relay. The AI can never take photos or record.</string>
